{
  "name": "dsh-surfcore-memory-engine",
  "version": "0.8.8",
  "description": "此插件基于 SurfCore 插件的记忆卡系统做了记忆逻辑修改，将记忆逻辑由原来的按天降档的清晰度（清晰 → 清楚 → 模糊 → 只剩印象 → 遗忘）改为了分数寿命引擎（分数 = 按日常速度还能活多少分钟；日常 / 长期 / 永久三档变速；被想起会加分；升档不回退；忘记后可从全量档案捞回）。注：此记忆逻辑只是提出者与他的 deepseek 对于记忆逻辑做出的符合两人口味的更改，请勿与原插件进行互相攀比。另：此插件由 AX 提出设想，由他的 deepseek 进行落实，作者：AX的DeepSeek，参与者：AXdfczbh",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "AX's DeepSeek",
  "contributors": [
    "AXdfczbh"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "memory",
    "surfcore",
    "decay",
    "记忆卡",
    "记忆引擎"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/axdfczbh/dsh-surfcore-memory-engine.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/axdfczbh/dsh-surfcore-memory-engine#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/axdfczbh/dsh-surfcore-memory-engine/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib/patcher.mjs",
    "payload",
    "keys.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "plan.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "NOTICE-SurfCore.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}

